<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#AfterActionReview> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos#Concept> .
<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#AfterActionReview> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/created> "18/12/2020" .
<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#AfterActionReview> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/creator> "Lucy" .
<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#AfterActionReview> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "HSE Incident Management Framework - Guidance 2020" .
<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#AfterActionReview> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An After Action Review (AAR) is a structured facilitated discussion of an event, the outcome of which enables the individuals involved in the event to understand why the outcome differed from that which was expected and what learning can be identified to assist improvement" .
