# https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#Anticipate
<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#Anticipate> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#Anticipate> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos#Concept> .
<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#Anticipate> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/created> "07/09/2020" .
<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#Anticipate> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/creator> "Rob" .
<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#Anticipate> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "HSE Part 1" .
<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#Anticipate> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Anticipation involves thinking ahead and envisioning the things that are most likely to contribute to risk or safety failures. Safety from this perspective therefore involves looking ahead and identifying the hazards and risks that may cause harm if left unmanaged." .
<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#Anticipate> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Anticipate" .
<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#Anticipate> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos#definition> "Anticipation involves thinking ahead and envisioning the things that are most likely to contribute to risk or safety failures. Safety from this perspective therefore involves looking ahead and identifying the hazards and risks that may cause harm if left unmanaged." .
<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#Anticipate> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos#prefLabel> "Anticipate" .
