<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#ConcernsAndEnquiries> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A concern or enquiry is a problem raised that can be resolved/responded to straight away, (by the end of the next working day). These are not reported as complaints and fall outside the complaints management arrangements" .
