<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#HarmToAPerson> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos#definition> "Any physical or psychological injury or damage to the health of a person, including both temporary and permanent injury" .
<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#HarmToAPerson> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos#definition> "Physical or psychological injury related to a person i.e. service user, staff member or member of the public." .
