<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#HumanFactors> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An understanding of human limitations, designing the workplace and the equipment healthcare providers use to allow for variability in humans and human performance." .
