<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#QPSAdvisor> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "For consistency purposes this term is used throughout the document to refer to the person whose role it is to advise and support a service in relation to their Quality and Patient Safety processes and response. It is noted that the title given to this role can vary between services e.g. Quality & Safety Manager, Quality, Risk and Safety Manager etc" .
