<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#ReportableCircumstance> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A situation in which there was significant potential for harm, but no incident occurred. (WHO Conceptual Framework for the International Classification for Patient Safety 2009)." .
