<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#RiskIdentification> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "HSE Part 1/ISO 31000:2009" .
<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#RiskIdentification> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A systematic process applied to the organisation’s objectives and activities to identify possible risk sources and causes and potential consequences or impacts should a risk occur." .
<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#RiskIdentification> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Risk Identification" .
<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#RiskIdentification> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos#definition> "A systematic process applied to the organisation’s objectives and activities to identify possible risk sources and causes and potential consequences or impacts should a risk occur." .
<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#RiskIdentification> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos#prefLabel> "Risk Identification" .
# 
# https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#RiskInclusionCriteria
