<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#ServiceProvider> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "(External to HSE) Part 7, Section 38 of the Health Act 2004 defines a Service Provider as a person with whom the Executive enters into an arrangement for the provision of a health or personal social service on behalf of the Executive, e.g. Nursing Homes, non-statutory Residential/Respite Homes/Centres etc." .
<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#ServiceProvider> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Service Provider" .
