<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#ServiceUser> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The term “service user” in relation to a health services provider means a person to whom a health service is, or has been, provided" .
