<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#TheNationalTreasuryManagementAgency(NTMA)> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The NTMA is a State body which operates with a commercial remit to provide asset and liability management services to Government and is designated as the State Claims Agency when it performs the claims and risk management functions delegated to it under the National Treasury Management Agency (Amendment) Act, 2000" .
